                        "entry_id": "cda891df-070e-3717-983e-1fdf20bab28c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sweetened thick drink or thin gruel made from cornmeal, served hot."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "efd74633-e3af-4860-9838-70ef369a0a49",
                                "sense_id": "7f80456d-a998-33e8-ba4d-68aadec9b4c4",
                                "text": "\"Pan fino, pan bianco!\" screams the baker; and other cries from the vendors of atole, huevos, and leche, are uttered in shrill, discordant voices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "675eb737-8705-4993-ada4-7dbc85c12038",
                                "sense_id": "7f80456d-a998-33e8-ba4d-68aadec9b4c4",
                                "text": "Since the days of the Tarascans, the corn-loving folks of Michoacan have enjoyed atole, a maize-based gruel flavored with chocolate, fruit, tamarind, or herbs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49ae7087-b4a0-41ae-94ae-23d9b39ef502",
                                "sense_id": "7f80456d-a998-33e8-ba4d-68aadec9b4c4",
                                "text": "Visitors can learn to make their own tortillas or sample the traditional cornmeal drink atole."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
